      "text": [
        "601 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: فِي قَوْلِ اَللَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ: «۝ إِنَّ اَلصَّلاٰةَ كٰانَتْ عَلَى اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ كِتٰاباً مَوْقُوتاً ۝»\nقَالَ «مَفْرُوضاً."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.601 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said regarding the words of Allah (swt),: \"Indeed, prayer has been decreed upon the believers a timed decree\" (Surah An-Nisa 4:103).\nImam (as) said: \"It means obligatory (prescribed)”."
        ]
      }
